{"id":23084,"name":"Fluvanna County","slug":"fluvanna-county","state":"Virginia","code":"VA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/virginia-tax-deeds-your-guide-to-profitable-real-estate-investment/fluvanna-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:53:17","facts":null,"bodyHtml":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Fluvanna County, Virginia Tax Sales: A Simple Guide for Investors</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Buying tax-delinquent properties in Fluvanna County can be a great investment. But before you bid, you need to know how the process works. This guide covers the auction process, bidding rules, and payment requirements so you can participate with confidence.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-tax-sales-work-in-fluvanna-county\"><strong>How Tax Sales Work in Fluvanna County</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Fluvanna County holds tax sales <strong>when property owners fail to pay their taxes</strong>. The county auctions these properties to recover unpaid amounts.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Auction Date &amp; Time:</strong> Check the <strong>Auction Calendar</strong> for scheduled sales. Previous auctions have been announced in September, with times provided in official sale notices.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Auction Location:</strong> The auction site is included in official announcements.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Registration:</strong> All bidders must register before the auction date.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redemption Period:</strong> Property owners can reclaim their property by <strong>paying all overdue taxes, penalties, and fees</strong> before the sale.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-bidding-and-payment-details\"><strong>Bidding and Payment Details</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re planning to bid, follow these key requirements:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Deposit &amp; Buyer’s Premium:</strong> Winning bidders must pay a <strong>deposit</strong>, usually a percentage of the sale price. Some auctions may also include a <strong>buyer’s premium</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Final Payment:</strong> The remaining balance must be paid <strong>within the period stated in the auction terms</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Property Condition:</strong> All properties are sold <strong>as-is, with no warranties</strong>. Do your research before bidding.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-who-to-contact-for-auction-details\"><strong>Who to Contact for Auction Details</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>For tax sale questions, reach out to:</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Taxing Authority Consulting Services, P.C. (TACS)</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"http://www.taxva.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">www.taxva.com</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> (866) 951-0742</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Fluvanna County Treasurer’s Office</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">drittenhouse@fluvannacounty.org</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> (434) 591-1945</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Address:</strong> 34 Palmyra Way, P.O. Box 299, Palmyra, VA 22963</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Fluvanna-County-Courthouse-Virginia-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-23241 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Fluvanna County Courthouse Virginia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div c